00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:16.803
Uh... I thought | was calling Saji's phone...

00:02:16.803 --> 00:02:19.014
Who are you?

00:02:19.014 --> 00:02:24.353
He's not here. Or should
| say he left while | was asleep.

00:02:25.395 --> 00:02:29.191
By any chance... are you
that girl from this afternoon?

00:02:29.191 --> 00:02:33.028
The one who really sucks
at grappling... Mou-chan, was it?

00:02:33.028 --> 00:02:35.155
W-What?

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:39.534
Saji was complaining that an opponent so weak
would black out before tapping out.

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:41.662
You don't know how to finish.

00:02:45.332 --> 00:02:50.337
Making fun of me... Saji, you're mean!

00:02:54.174 --> 00:02:55.384
That dummy!

00:03:01.056 --> 00:03:04.559
You always were a poor finisher, Mou-chan.

00:03:04.559 --> 00:03:05.936
Tag.

00:03:05.936 --> 00:03:06.853
Uh...

00:03:06.853 --> 00:03:09.523
