00:04:04.619 --> 00:04:08.957
Wh-Who'd ever love a guy like that...

00:04:08.957 --> 00:04:10.584
You're so obvious.

00:04:10.584 --> 00:04:14.755
| was under orders to keep an eye on him...

00:04:14.755 --> 00:04:19.009
But | ended up falling for him,
so who am | to talk?

00:04:20.177 --> 00:04:22.596
Keep an eye on him? What do you mean?

00:04:22.596 --> 00:04:27.934
You... really don't know
anything about him, do you?

00:04:31.605 --> 00:04:37.152
A meeting to form an anti-Totaku alliance
is being held today at Yoshu Academy.

00:04:37.152 --> 00:04:41.823
Rakuyo's Kayuu is af that
meeting to keep it from happening.

00:04:41.823 --> 00:04:46.536
But the person pulling the
strings at the meetfing is..

00:04:46.536 --> 00:04:48.872
It should be around here...

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:55.837
Run! Hurry! It's a m-monster!

00:04:55.837 --> 00:04:58.298
