00:06:35.145 --> 00:06:36.771
Dammit!

00:06:36.771 --> 00:06:40.317
How long are we going
to be cooped up in here?!

00:06:40.317 --> 00:06:42.110
Calm down...

00:06:42.110 --> 00:06:47.824
We'll be released once the
Federation seftles matters.

00:06:47.824 --> 00:06:50.744
But | don't know about those guys..

00:06:50.744 --> 00:06:52.954
| don't think the three
schools that control Kanto:

00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:58.168
Kyosho, Seito, and Nanyo will
just capitulate fo Nanban's army.

00:06:58.168 --> 00:07:04.090
True. Add to that the fact that we don't know
who's connected with whom behind the scenes.

00:07:04.090 --> 00:07:05.342
Huh?

00:07:05.342 --> 00:07:08.428
Wait... What did you mean by that?

00:07:08.428 --> 00:07:12.974
Nothing. | was just talking fo myself.

00:07:12.974 --> 00:07:16.519
If there were a connection,
we wouldn't be here now, would we?

00:07:16.519 --> 00:07:18.146
There is a connection!

00:07:18.146 --> 00:07:24.986
There was a Kyosho fighter, Ten'i, among the
Nanban fighters who attacked us on the ship.

00:07:24.986 --> 00:07:29.658
Now that you mention it,
| thought she looked familiar.

00:07:30.951 --> 00:07:32.369
Huh?

00:07:32.369 --> 00:07:35.956
Hey. | had nothing to do with it.
I'm a prisoner, just like you.

00:07:35.956 --> 00:07:37.999
Explain.

00:07:37.999 --> 00:07:42.545
She wasn't part of our main group...
she was in a special position.

00:07:42.545 --> 00:07:47.133
There were even rumors that Shibai,
the tactician, was using her.

00:07:47.133 --> 00:07:49.803
Tactician Chuutatsu Shibai...

00:07:49.803 --> 00:07:52.472
The man who manipulated Kyosho's strategy

00:07:52.472 --> 00:07:57.227
and disappeared with Sousou
the Devil, in the Battle of Red Cliffs.

00:07:57.227 --> 00:07:58.853
Then...

00:07:58.853 --> 00:08:02.732
Who is Kentei, really?

00:08:02.732 --> 00:08:06.236
Qur first priority is figuring
out how to get out of here.

00:08:06.236 --> 00:08:07.529
Maybe we could...

00:08:07.529 --> 00:08:09.864
Any good ideas?

00:08:09.864 --> 00:08:11.408
Hmm...

00:08:12.701 --> 00:08:14.160
I've got if!

00:08:47.068 --> 00:08:50.405
Come on! You knocked him out!

00:08:50.405 --> 00:08:53.950
Now we can't ask him where
Koukin and the others are!

00:08:53.950 --> 00:08:58.038
| thought he saw through us, so I...

00:08:58.038 --> 00:09:01.416
| made this disguise so no one could fell..

00:09:05.128 --> 00:09:08.548
Master! There are stairs up ahead.

00:09:08.548 --> 00:09:11.134
