00:09:12.427 --> 00:09:15.805
You're kidding, right?

00:09:19.142 --> 00:09:21.311
Bachin, what's the matter?

00:09:21.311 --> 00:09:25.565
Seems like a storeroom...
Looks like there's a room at the back.

00:09:33.073 --> 00:09:34.324
That's...

00:09:47.420 --> 00:09:48.755
Now!

00:09:59.808 --> 00:10:02.102
Il return this to Kan...

00:10:02.102 --> 00:10:04.104
Not good, Bachin!

00:10:04.104 --> 00:10:06.189
You knocked them out again!

00:10:06.189 --> 00:10:10.860
Well... you did the same thing, Master.

00:10:14.322 --> 00:10:15.990
Do it right this fime.

00:10:15.990 --> 00:10:17.617
Gotchal

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:22.122
Someone's coming! He seems awfully big.

00:10:22.122 --> 00:10:25.208
Good, he won't be so
easy to knock unconscious.

00:10:30.630 --> 00:10:31.631
Huh?!

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:38.388
No, Mas... fer!

00:10:38.388 --> 00:10:39.889
What?!

00:10:41.141 --> 00:10:44.310
So... she's your friend?

00:10:44.310 --> 00:10:47.355
Fweind... yeth...

00:10:47.355 --> 00:10:51.151
That makes us friends, foo! Nice fo meet you!

00:10:51.151 --> 00:10:52.318
Pleasure...

00:10:52.318 --> 00:10:57.699
