This place is too big to search.

00:14:07.847 --> 00:14:11.517
So much for returning this to Kan...

00:14:11.517 --> 00:14:14.062
What? Is this what | think it is?

00:14:14.062 --> 00:14:16.606
| found it on the way here.

00:14:19.442 --> 00:14:21.903
The Reienkyo...

00:14:21.903 --> 00:14:26.866
| can feel it. This wants fo refurn fo Kan.

00:14:29.786 --> 00:14:33.081
